# Operating System files
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
*.stackdump
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon

# Logs & Runtime Process IDs
*.log
daemon.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock
DevToolsActivePort

# Temporary, Cache & Backup files
.cache/
temp/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.backup
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# IDE & Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Environment & Local secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Dependencies and locally generated client packages
node_modules/
build/
dist/
bootstrap.js
asar-extracted/
*.asar
*.asar.*

# Personal wallpaper and its generated offline cache
assets/*
!assets/.gitkeep
